   "body": "For LOT-140 (from LOT-091, #358): the per-account notification ledger (`NotificationLedgerStore`, HFRStorage) is the \"already notified\" state of FEAT-005. If the kept legacy BGTask notifies new MPs from its own `nb_mp`-style count while the App Intent (LOT-141) uses the ledger, one MP can be notified twice. Suggestion: the BGTask check calls `markCheckedIfDue` and `recordNews` with a summary holding only the unread count. See `docs/lots/LOT-091-notification-ledger.md` once #358 lands.",
   "author_association": "OWNER",
